# Go source is LF in the repository and in every working tree, so gofmt
# reports the same thing on Windows as it does on Linux.
*.go text eol=lf

# The embedded notices reproduce MITRE's license text, so it is the same bytes
# on every platform the binary is built on.
internal/notices/*.md text eol=lf

# A dataset's test data is the source's data as it was taken, checked by its
# SHA-256, so its bytes are never changed on checkout.
internal/dataset/**/testdata/** -text
